+## Invalid Configuration
+
+Bivvy validates each config file when loading. If a file contains invalid
+YAML syntax or has content that is not a YAML mapping (e.g., a bare string
+or list instead of key-value pairs), Bivvy reports a parse error and
+refuses to proceed. Empty files and comment-only files are treated as
+no-ops — they neither override nor interfere with other config layers.
+
